# Niazi Mobile Mart - Environment Configuration Example
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# IMPORTANT SECURITY NOTICE:
# This project is a desktop retail ERP powered by Tauri v2, Rust, and SQLite.
# Authentication is strictly offline-first.
# DO NOT store passwords, recovery keys, or secret tokens in this file.
# The initial administrator account MUST be provisioned via the secure
# first-run bootstrap wizard in the application, not through environment variables.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Application Environment Mode ('development' | 'production')
VITE_APP_ENV=development

# Optional Frontend Web Fallback Port (for headless browser development only)
VITE_PORT=5173

# Optional Local API Gateway (if running local development mock server)
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:3000

# Canonical Retail Organization (Locked)
# Organization UUID: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
# Main Branch UUID:   00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
